     ],
     "value": "Regulated by guanine nucleotide exchange factors (GEFs) which promote the exchange of bound GDP for free GTP (Probable). Regulated by GTPase activating proteins (GAPs) which increase the GTP hydrolysis activity (Probable). Inhibited by GDP dissociation inhibitors (GDIs) (Probable)"
    }
